## **Rollback Plan**

If deployment fails:
1. Check application logs: `az webapp log tail --resource-group rg-futane-agro --name backend`
2. Revert infrastructure: `az deployment group delete --resource-group rg-futane-agro`
3. Recreate from bicep: `az deployment group create --resource-group rg-futane-agro --template-file infra/main.bicep`
4. Check Key Vault secrets are populated
5. Redeploy application
